    "file_name": "XIN_ENG_20061101.0007.tml",
    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061101.0007\n\nISLAMABAD, Nov. 1 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nHouse roof collapse kills 1, injures 5 in Pakistan\n\n\n\n\nA house roof collapsed in Pakistan's largest port city Karachi, killing a baby and injuring five persons of the family that included her parents and two sisters, local private Geo TV reported on Wednesday.\n\nPolice said that the roof and walls of the dilapidated house of a junk dealer at Gharibabad of Liaquatabad area in Karachi came crashing with a bang to bury the whole family sleeping therein under the debris.\n\nThe neighbors hearing the thud of the collapsing roof came out rescuing six persons and shifted them to local hospital, where the doctors pronounced the five-month-old baby dead, according to the report.\n\nTwo girls were in serious conditions, the report said.",
